2.0.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/91
- Split holotape into parts, app.js, title.js, timer.js, and stopwatch.js
- Major revisions to Timer formatting
- Added LED functionality to Timer for alert, replacing screen flash and sound
- Added ALARM folder for sound alert type, allowing user to choose and customize their notificaiton sound
- Added whole new Stopwatch funtion
- Stopwatch includes start/stop functionality, Lap counting and a reset button
- Both timer and stopwatch allow user to return to menu/title.js
- Update preview images
- Set file names to be uppercase for consistency with other holotapes

